| The cart hits the ±2 m boundary despite the bias. | Count how many times `|x| > 1.8` occurs. | Lower `X_LIMIT` to 1.5 m (more aggressive centering). |
| Learning‑based agents (if you later add them) need a baseline. | Use this rule as a “teacher” policy for imitation learning. | No change to rule itself – just record (state, action) pairs. |

### 5️⃣ Bottom line  

- **Best performing strategy**: the PD‑plus‑dead‑zone rule (S‑3).  
