|--------|--------|-----------------|
| `abs(pd) > DEAD_ZONE` | Pole is sufficiently tilted or moving fast. | Immediate corrective push opposite the fall direction. |
| `x > X_LIMIT` / `x < -X_LIMIT` | Cart is drifting toward a track edge. | Small “centering” push that prevents a later failure. |
| `return 2` (default) | Inside dead‑zone and centre‑band. | Keeps the controller deterministic; the pole stays balanced for many steps (as seen in the 500‑step run). |

