        if x >  2.0:          # too far right
                action = 1    # nudge left
        elif x < -2.0:        # too far left
                action = 2    # nudge right
        else:
                # 4. Neutral zone – cart is near centre and pole is almost upright.
                # Any small bias works; we keep the “right” bias that the experiments
                # showed to be harmless.
                action = 2
```

