| Position dead‑zone `δ = 0.05 m` | 0.05 | 0.04 – 0.07 | Shrinking `δ` reduces the time the bias is used, expanding it makes the bias dominate longer. |
| Centre bias direction | Right (`action=2`) | Right or Left (experiment) | In some stochastic seeds the drift may be opposite; you can flip the bias if you notice a systematic drift to the right. |

