## ✅ Bottom line  

**The simplest tilt‑error controller, with a tight dead‑zone and a tiny optional centering rule, is already optimal.**  
The extra velocity‑ or aggressive‑centering rules only add noise.  
Adopt the refined rule set above, and you will consistently achieve the maximum episode length of **500 steps**.
