θ ≈  0.001, ω ≈ -0.305 → |θ+0.9·ω| > 0.013 → sign negative → action = 1 (left)
```

Every step follows the rule, and the pole never exceeds the ±0.2095 rad angle limit.  

#### 1.2 What the weaker strategies missed  

