| 3 | `[-0.219, ‑0.202, ‑0.005, 0.279]` | `|θ+0.9·ω| = |‑0.005+0.251| = 0.256 > 0.013` → positive → **push right (2)** | ✔️ – the pole is now moving right (ω > 0) and the cart is left of centre; a right push recentres the pole. |
