* Swapping the tie‑break to “push left” (Strategy B) gave a slightly lower average (470) because the deterministic bias sometimes forced the cart in the opposite direction of a slow drift, causing a premature position failure.

**3. Updated rule set (the one that consistently reaches 500)**  

