| Position dead‑band `±0.05` | Keeps the cart within the central 10 % of the track while still giving a clear corrective direction. A narrower band (±0.04) left a few “no‑action” steps that occasionally let the cart drift. |
| Deterministic tie‑break → right | Any fixed choice works; we keep the same as the successful runs to avoid stochasticity. |

